Package: nansenbiomass
Title: Reproducible Survey Biomass Reconstruction with StoX and sdmTMB
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R:
    person("Nikolaos", "Nikolioudakis", , "nikolaos.nikolioudakis@hi.no",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reconstructs biomass and abundance estimates for demersal
    bottom-trawl surveys with a design-based framework (StoX swept-area)
    and a model-based framework (sdmTMB). Every estimate traces back to a
    versioned configuration, a code version, a package snapshot and a
    fixed random seed. Outputs pass a disclosure check before release,
    and a synthetic survey generator supports testing without real data.
